This code changes the player movement in such a way that it will stop the player from moving horizontally towards the obstacle when colliding with the side of the obstacle.

To fix the gravity reversal and achieve the desired collision mechanism, you need to modify the existing code as follows:

1. In the `applyGravity()` function, change the sign of the gravity addition from positive to negative:
```javascript
