```kotlin
.clickable(onClick = {
    navController.navigate("songDetail/${song.id}?previewUrl=${song.preview}")
})
```

4. Update the navigation in the `NavHost` to receive preview URL and pass it to the `SongDetailScreen`:

```kotlin
composable("songDetail/{songId}?previewUrl={previewUrl}") { backStackEntry ->
