```

3. Instead of clearing all `TestedDateTimes` when there are no non-used dates or times, you can selectively clear only those dates or times that have no available slots.

4. In the `GetRandomDate` method, if the `_applicant.DateSelector` property is not set to `DateSelector.Custom`, you can skip the whole LINQ expression used for filtering custom dates.

