除了使用librtmp发送@setDataFrame和onMetaData之外，还有一些其他的方法可以发送元数据，具体如下：

1. 使用ffmpeg库发送元数据

可以使用ffmpeg库中的AVFormatContext和AVDictionary来发送元数据。具体代码如下：

```c
AVFormatContext *fmt_ctx = avformat_alloc_context();
// 初始化fmt_ctx

// 设置元数据
AVDictionary *metadata = NULL;
av_dict_set(&metadata, "duration", "10.0", 0); // 设置媒体文件时长为10秒
// 设置其他元数据
fmt_ctx->metadata = metadata;

// 输出到RTMP服务器
avio_open2(&fmt_ctx->pb, "rtmp://example.com/live/stream", AVIO_FLAG_WRITE, NULL, NULL);
avformat_write_header(fmt_ctx, NULL);

// 释放资源
avformat_close_input(&fmt_ctx);
```

这里我们只设置了duration属性，其他属性也可以通过AVDictionary来设置。

2. 使用flvmeta工具发送元数据

flvmeta是一个开源的命令行工具，可以用来操作FLV格式的文件，包括添加、删除、修改元数据等。我们可以使用flvmeta来添加元数据，然后将FLV文件推流到RTMP服务器上。具体命令如下：

```
flvmeta -i input.flv --add "duration=10.0" --add "width=640" --add "height=480" -o output.flv
```

这里我们添加了duration、width和height属性，其他属性也可以通过--add来添加。

3. 使用obs-ffmpeg-mux工具发送元数据

obs-ffmpeg-mux是一个基于ffmpeg的工具，可以将任意视频流转换成RTMP协议的流并推送到RTMP服务器上。它也支持通过"-metadata"参数来设置元数据。具体命令如下：

```
obs-ffmpeg-mux.exe -i input.mp4 -c copy -metadata "duration=10.0" -f flv rtmp://example.com/live/stream
```

这里我们也添加了duration属性，其他属性也可以通过-metadata来添加。

Here's an example of how you can create an animation in Jetpack Compose that moves a red circle from one position to another in one second:

```kotlin
import androidx.compose.animation.core.*
import androidx.compose.foundation.Canvas
import androidx.compose.foundation.background
import androidx.compose.foundation.layout.fillMaxSize
import androidx.compose.foundation.layout.Box
import androidx.compose.material.MaterialTheme
import androidx.compose.runtime.*
import androidx.compose.ui.Modifier
import androidx.compose.ui.graphics.Color
import androidx.compose.ui.graphics.drawscope.drawCircle
import androidx.compose.ui.unit.dp

@Composable
fun AnimatedCircle() {
    // Initialize the animation specs
    val transition = rememberInfiniteTransition()

    // Define the start and end positions of the circle
    val fromPosition = Offset(50.dp.toPx(), 50.dp.toPx())
    val toPosition = Offset(250.dp.toPx(), 250.dp.toPx())

    // Define the animation values for x and y positions
    val xPosition by transition.animateValue(
        initialValue = fromPosition.x,
        targetValue = toPosition.x,
        animationSpec = infiniteRepeatable(
            animation = tween(1000, easing = LinearEasing)
        )
    )
    val yPosition by transition.animateValue(
        initialValue = fromPosition.y,
        targetValue = toPosition.y,
        animationSpec = infiniteRepeatable(
            animation = tween(1000, easing = LinearEasing)
        )
    )

    // Draw the circle on a canvas
    Box(
        modifier = Modifier.fillMaxSize()
    ) {
        Canvas(
            modifier = Modifier.background(MaterialTheme.colors.background)
        ) {
            drawCircle(
                color = Color.Red,
                radius = 20.dp.toPx(),
                center = Offset(xPosition, yPosition)
            )
        }
    }
}
```

In the example above, we use the `rememberInfiniteTransition` function to create an infinite transition that will repeat the animation. We use the `animateValue` function to define the animation values for the x and y positions of the circle, with the `initialValue` set to the start position of the circle and the `targetValue` set to the end position of the circle. The `animationSpec` argument is set to use a linear easing and a duration of 1000 milliseconds (1 second). Finally, we draw a red circle on a canvas using the `drawCircle` function with the position of the circle set to the animated x and y values.

Note that the values for the circle's position in pixels are calculated using the `toPx()` function to convert from DP to pixels. Also, the `Modifier.background(MaterialTheme.colors.background)` is used to set the canvas background color to the theme's background color. You can remove this modifier if you don't want a background color.

在C语言的librtmp库中，关于发送@setDataFrame和onMetaData，可以使用以下代码片段。该片段设置了包含duration、width、height、videodatarate、videocodecid、audiodatarate、audiocodecid、filesize等关键信息的metadata发送给RTMP服务器。参考代码片段如下：

```c
#include <stdio.h>
#include <stdlib.h>
#include "librtmp/rtmp.h"
#include "librtmp/log.h"

#define FLV_AUDIO_SAMPLETYPE_MASK 0xfc
#define FLV_AUDIO_CODECID_OFFSET 4

int main() {
    RTMP *rtmp;
    RTMPPacket packet;
    const char *url = "rtmp://example.com/path/stream_name";

    // 初始化librtmp
    RTMP_LogSetLevel(RTMP_LOGDEBUG);
    RTMP_LogSetCallback(rtmp_log_debug);

    rtmp = RTMP_Alloc();
    RTMP_Init(rtmp);
    if (!RTMP_SetupURL(rtmp, (char *) url)) {
        printf("RTMP_SetupURL failed\n");
        return -1;
    }

    RTMP_EnableWrite(rtmp);

    if (!RTMP_Connect(rtmp, NULL) || !RTMP_ConnectStream(rtmp, 0)) {
        printf("RTMP_Connect failed\n");
        return -1;
    }

    // 构建@setDataFrame和onMetaData 数据
    char *metadata = (char *) malloc(1024);
    char *buf = metadata;

    int metadata_len = 0;
    metadata_len += AValCpyStr(&buf, "@setDataFrame");
    metadata_len += AValCpyStr(&buf, "onMetaData");

    metadata_len += AValCpyStr(&buf, "duration");
    metadata_len += EAValCpyInt16(&buf, 0x2, 0x20000, 1000); // duration = 1000ms

    metadata_len += AValCpyStr(&buf, "width");
    metadata_len += EAValCpyInt16(&buf, 0x2, 0x20000, 1280); // width = 1280

    metadata_len += AValCpyStr(&buf, "height");
    metadata_len += EAValCpyInt16(&buf, 0x2, 0x20000, 720); // height = 720

    metadata_len += AValCpyStr(&buf, "videodatarate");
    metadata_len += EAValCpyInt32(&buf, 0x2, 0x20000, 1024000); // videodatarate = 1024kbps

    int32_t flv_video_codecid = 0x7 << FLV_AUDIO_CODECID_OFFSET;
    metadata_len += AValCpyStr(&buf, "videocodecid");
    metadata_len += EAValCpyInt16(&buf, 0x2, 0x20000, flv_video_codecid);

    metadata_len += AValCpyStr(&buf, "audiodatarate");
    metadata_len += EAValCpyInt32(&buf, 0x2, 0x20000, 256000); // audiodatarate = 256kbps

    int32_t flv_audio_codecid = 0xa << FLV_AUDIO_CODECID_OFFSET;
    metadata_len += AValCpyStr(&buf, "audiocodecid");
    metadata_len += EAValCpyInt16(&buf, 0x2, 0x20000, flv_audio_codecid);

    metadata_len += AValCpyStr(&buf, "filesize");
    metadata_len += EAValCpyInt64(&buf, 0x2, 0x20000, 0); // filesize = 0

    // 发送RTMPPacket
    RTMPPacket_Alloc(&packet, metadata_len);
    RTMPPacket_Reset(&packet);

    packet.m_packetType = RTMP_PACKET_TYPE_INFO;
    packet.m_nChannel = 0x04;
    packet.m_nInfoField2 = rtmp->m_stream_id;
    // 复制metadata
    memcpy(packet.m_body, metadata, metadata_len);
    packet.m_nBodySize = metadata_len;

    if (!RTMP_SendPacket(rtmp, &packet, 0)) {
        printf("Send @setDataFrame onMetadata error.\n");
        return -1;
    }

    printf("Send @setDataFrame onMetadata success.\n");

    // 结束工作
    RTMPPacket_Free(&packet);
    if (metadata != NULL) {
        free(metadata);
        metadata = NULL;
    }
    RTMP_Close(rtmp);
    RTMP_Free(rtmp);

    return 0;
}
```

注意，此代码片段仅设置并发送了元数据，您需要根据您的实际项目需求来对具体的视频、音频信息进行发送。

AValCpyStr()是一个自定义的函数，用于将给定的字符串值复制到缓冲区。返回值是写入的字节数。为了更好地理解这个函数，让我们看一下一个可能的实现：

```c
#include <string.h>

typedef struct _AVal {
    const char *av_val;
    int av_len;
} AVal;

int AValCpyStr(char **dst, const char *src) {
    AVal aval;
    aval.av_val = src;
    aval.av_len = strlen(src);

    *(*dst)++ = aval.av_len >> 8;
    *(*dst)++ = aval.av_len & 0xff;
    memcpy(*dst, aval.av_val, aval.av_len);
    *dst += aval.av_len;

    return 2 + aval.av_len;
}
```

这个函数的主要作用是将一个字符串值复制到一个缓冲区。首先，将字符串的长度写入两个字节，然后将字符串内容写入缓冲区。除了写入长度和内容外，还更新了dst指针位置，以便在下一次调用时可以接着填充其他元数据值。

示例：

```c
    char buffer[1024] = {0};
    char *buf = buffer;

    int len = 0;
    len += AValCpyStr(&buf, "duration");
    len += AValCpyStr(&buf, "width");
```

`AValCpyStr()`在这个示例中被用来填充缓冲区，用于发送元数据信息。

