};
```

In this class, the `GenerateTerrain` method would internally call `GenerateHeightMap` and `ConvertHeightMapToMeshData` to generate the terrain and store this information within the class. You can then access the resulting `GameObject` using the `GetTerrainObject` method.

After creating an instance of the `Terrain` class, you can generate the terrain and add it to your `Scene`:

```cpp
