3. Configure DNS RR (Round Robin):

By default, Kubernetes internal DNS supports Round-robin (RR) DNS. Ensure that your DNS configuration is well set up to distribute the requests among your available instances evenly. When multiple IPs are associated with a single domain, make sure the DNS response contains all relevant IPs.

