3. Made the `RollDice()` method `static` so it can be called in the `Main` method.
4. Added a while loop in `RollDice()` to continue rolling the dice until the user types "Exit".
5. Implemented case-insensitive comparison for the user input.
6. Changed the range of the random number generation to include 1 and exclude 46.

