The problem seems to be that you update `currentFrame` only after successfully presenting the swapchain image (`vkQueuePresentKHR`). The `currentFrame` should actually be updated at the beginning of each iteration of your main application loop, regardless of whether the previous iteration succeeded in presenting the image or not.

