In this example, the Title property of each PieSeries object specifies the label name for the corresponding slice in the PieChart. You can also set the FontSize and FontWeight properties of the PieSeries object to customize the appearance of the labels. Then, in your XAML, you can bind the Series property of the PieChart control to the Data property of your ViewModel, like this:

