To create a Firebase function that queries a list of users where a field is not empty, you can follow the steps below:

1. First, ensure that you have installed the Firebase CLI and initialized your project with Firebase Functions. You can refer to this guide on how to set up Functions in a Firebase project: https://firebase.google.com/docs/functions/get-started

2. In your Firebase Functions `index.js` file, import the required packages and initialize the app:

```javascript
const functions = require("firebase-functions");
const admin = require("firebase-admin");

admin.initializeApp();
```

3. Define your custom Firebase Function that queries a list of users where a field is not empty:

```javascript
const getUsersWithField = functions.https.onCall(async (data, context) => {
  const fieldName = data.fieldName;

  // Check if the field name is provided
  if (!fieldName) {
    throw new functions.https.HttpsError("invalid-argument", "Field name is required.");
  }

  // Get Firestore DB instance
  const db = admin.firestore();

  // Query users where the field is not empty
  const querySnapshot = await db.collection("users").where(fieldName, "!=", "").get();

  // Format and return the result
  const users = [];
  querySnapshot.forEach(doc => {
    users.push({
      id: doc.id,
      data: doc.data()
    });
  });

  return users;
});
```

4. Export the function:

```javascript
exports.getUsersWithField = getUsersWithField;
```

5. In your client code, call this function using the Firebase SDK:

```javascript
const fieldName = "YOUR_FIELD_NAME";
const getUsersWithField = firebase.functions().httpsCallable("getUsersWithField");
getUsersWithField({ fieldName })
  .then(result => {
    const users = result.data;
    console.log("Users with field not empty: ", users);
  })
  .catch(error => {
    console.error("Error getting users with field not empty: ", error);
  });
```

Make sure to replace `"YOUR_FIELD_NAME"` with the actual name of the field you want to check. This will give you a list of users where the specified field is not empty.

