11. Go to Window > ML-Agents > Runtime Trainer.
12. In the settings, select your "agent.yaml" file for the "Behavior Name" and check "Control".
13. Click on "Start Training" to start training.

To switch between keyboard and agent control, toggle the "Control" checkbox in the Runtime Trainer window. When "Control" is checked, the agent will be controlled by the neural network, and when unchecked, you'll control the agent using the WASD keys on the keyboard.

